description:
Update repository documentation and perform a final implementation sweep so the next developer understands exactly what the cart does today and what it deliberately does not do. Remove stale comments/TODOs that incorrectly say native cart is forbidden, while preserving warnings that this is not a real ordering system.

Document:
- bundled Menu is the source of purchasable items/prices;
- cart state is on-device only and versioned;
- Submit Order creates a local receipt/confirmation then clears the cart;
- there is no customer account, store selection, tax, tip, payment, promo, backend order, kitchen transmission, fulfillment, order history, status tracking, or external provider integration;
- where a future real OrderSubmissionService would plug in;
- how to run cart tests/E2E.

Then inspect the final repository and release-like app to ensure no hidden remote dependency was introduced.
